      "html" : "<\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161293\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161293\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\">For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm, 1 foot = 304.8 mm.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161294\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161294\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta.&#160;&#160;&#160;The maximum horizontal spacing of cast-iron pipe hangers shall be increased to 10 feet where 10-foot lengths of pipe are installed.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161295\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161295\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;For sizes 2 inches and smaller, a guide shall be installed midway between required vertical supports. Such guides shall prevent pipe movement in a direction perpendicular to the axis of the pipe.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "24617-html-3",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm, 1 foot = 304.8 mm.\n\n a. The maximum horizontal spacing of cast-iron pipe hangers shall be increased to 10 feet where 10-foot lengths of pipe are installed.\n\n b. For sizes 2 inches and smaller, a guide shall be installed midway between required vertical supports. Such guides shall prevent pipe movement in a direction perpendicular to the axis of the pipe."
    }
